TECHO5 Panel includes code and files from other open-source projects.

The APK carries TECHO5's daemon, echod (https://github.com/HuskerMinion/techo5, MIT), built for
Android as lib/arm64-v8a/libechod.so and lib/armeabi-v7a/libechod.so, and the wake word models as
assets/models. The entries below are carried from techo5's NOTICE for what the APK ships. The other
Go modules compiled into echod are listed in techo5's echod/go.mod, each under its own license,
which comes with its source. The app's own code (app/) is this repository's, under the MIT License
in LICENSE. This file and LICENSE are in the APK too, as assets/NOTICE and assets/LICENSE, and
beside the APK in each release.

